lic Revival or the Catholic Reformation, was the period of Catholic resurgence that was initiated in response to and as an alternative to, or from similar insights as, the Protestant Reformation. It was a comprehensive effort arising from the decrees of the Council of Trent.", "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Counter-Reformation</b>, also sometimes called the <b>Catholic Revival</b> or the <b>Catholic Reformation</b>, was the period of Catholic resurgence that was initiated in response to and as an alternative to, or from similar insights as, the Protestant Reformation. It was a comprehensive effort arising from the decrees of the Council of Trent.</p>"}